{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "A.O.Jarvis"}, "description": {"en-US": "Repositório F-Droid oficial do aplicativo A.O.Jarvis Android (Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis)."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/repo-icon.png", "sha256": "83f3bf96031672ea709ceeaf1bbab01617b800a7e5520e851b92bc86ee161f46", "size": 327901}}, "address": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis/gh-pages/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1795835446000, "categories": {"Internet": {"name": {"en-US": "Internet"}}, "System": {"name": {"en-US": "System"}}}}, "packages": {"com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx": {"metadata": {"added": 1795835353000, "categories": ["System", "Internet"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis/issues", "lastUpdated": 1795835441000, "license": "Apache-2.0", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis", "authorName": "A.O.Jarvis", "name": {"en-US": "A.O.Jarvis"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Android voice assistant with Gemini, local Wi-Fi Ollama, and offline voice mode.", "pt-BR": "Assistente de voz Android com Gemini, Ollama local na rede Wi-Fi e modo offline."}, "description": {"en-US": "A.O.Jarvis is a local-first Android personal voice assistant combining Gemini Cloud (via Firebase AI Logic), a local Ollama server over Wi-Fi, and offline voice commands.\n\nKey features:\n- Native Android SpeechRecognizer with offline support, lightweight \"Hey Jarvis\" AudioRecord wake-word detection, and customizable Text-to-Speech (TTS).\n- Persistent Foreground Service with wake-word standby, battery monitoring, and authenticated local Wi-Fi LAN triggers.\n- Seamless routing between Gemini Cloud, Gemini Live, and local Ollama over Wi-Fi.\n- Local Room database for voice command history, offline commands, memories, and multi-session conversations.\n- Remote update delivery via GitHub Releases and official F-Droid repository.\n", "pt-BR": "A.O.Jarvis é um assistente pessoal Android com arquitetura local-first que une Gemini Cloud (via Firebase AI Logic), servidor Ollama rodando no seu computador na rede Wi-Fi local e comandos de voz offline.\n\nPrincipais recursos:\n- Reconhecimento de voz nativo do Android (SpeechRecognizer) com suporte offline e resposta falada (TTS).\n- Foreground Service contínuo para escuta por palavra de ativação e gatilhos autenticados na rede local (Wi-Fi LAN).\n- Alternância inteligente entre Gemini Cloud, Gemini Live e Ollama local via Wi-Fi.\n- Gerenciamento multi-sessão de conversas, memórias locais persistentes e comandos de voz personalizados.\n- Integrações com aplicativos do dispositivo e auto-navegação guiada pelo próprio assistente.\n- Verificação remota de atualizações via GitHub Releases e repositório F-Droid pessoal.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx/en-US/icon_VIgUKn9poC4_iuwbCJrhqG6Cm7SeBo78BQMFe3sdGRw=.png", "sha256": "5488142a7f69a02e3f8aec1b089ae1a86e829bb49e068efc0503057b7b1d191c", "size": 317872}, "pt-BR": {"name": "/com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx/pt-BR/icon_VIgUKn9poC4_iuwbCJrhqG6Cm7SeBo78BQMFe3sdGRw=.png", "sha256": "5488142a7f69a02e3f8aec1b089ae1a86e829bb49e068efc0503057b7b1d191c", "size": 317872}}, "preferredSigner": "80d23800367a4cdfc9a18f342d48a5576644de56d7f9521a4c6355c40be1e961"}, "versions": {"05567b77dfe54a385d92c61d9b6de68787a82b5a24c6159b160beb799b0799af": {"added": 1795835353000, "file": {"name": "/A.O.Jarvis-1.3.3-vc7-05567b77.apk", "sha256": "05567b77dfe54a385d92c61d9b6de68787a82b5a24c6159b160beb799b0799af", "size": 30962871}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.3.3", "versionCode": 7, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["80d23800367a4cdfc9a18f342d48a5576644de56d7f9521a4c6355c40be1e961"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO"}, {"name": "a